Subject: Add separately selected frame timing diagnostics

Upstream-base: 0f5a757947b8778b680d4d1ae7e6df1792a514f2

Add timing/history diagnostic copies selected separately from the complete
original FrameCounter, Histogram and TimeRegions sources. Preserve all original
production constructor, timing, rendering and condition bodies. Extra scoped
initialization, bounds checks and diagnostic destructor access apply only when
MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_TIMING is enabled. Pair the original Histogram's allocated
bins with owning nlFree on the native host; keep its source sampling decisions.

diff --git a/include/Game/Debug/FrameCounter.h b/include/Game/Debug/FrameCounter.h
